BR>I told y’all to bring suits! Whatever! Party on! <BR> <BR> <BR>HEY, where’s Bookworm? What time does the library close? <BR> <BR> <BR>Hello… hey!… hold on… Itty, can you grab the phone. Audrey needs directions. <BR>  <BR> <BR>Wichitan and Wichitagirl are, what else?..  making out on the beanbag chair. <BR>Hey you two, get a room! <BR> <BR> <BR>Nutzger brought pizzas <BR> <BR> <BR>George is mixing the drinks <BR> <BR> <BR>I brought the ChexMix® <BR> <BR> <BR>Skov is makin’ S’mores! <BR> <BR> <BR>Armchair and Bmod are in the back – still on the computer. But when they finish, <BR>man they are going to PARTAY! HEY, shut that thing down and get out here <BR>you knuckle heads! <BR> <BR>Johno, Ivy, Marg, Freya, Crani… HEY! Put the Pictionary away and get up on that <BR>dance floor. <BR> <BR>Catcher!... Catcher! Can you spot Linnieskid. If he/she falls off that table someone’s <BR>gonna get hurt…cool…thanks! <BR> <BR> <BR>Stealth, Chief, Esse and Fox are starting a conga line. This can only mean one thing… LIMBO <BR> <BR> <BR>Ed_Neil is the designated driver. He’s still gonna get CRRRAZEE! <BR> <BR> <BR>Tom hasn’t shown up yet, but when he gets here he’s going to park his El Camino <BR>on the front lawn – and there’s nothing you can do about it Denny Boy! <BR> <BR> <BR>Damn! This thing is raving OFF THE HOOK! Uh oh… the cops are here…what’s that?.. <BR>HEY! They came to party too! <BR> <BR> <BR>Oh yeah the MONSTER tried to crash, but we all told him to go BTfK himself! <BR> <BR> <BR>And were all gonna be way too hung over to go to church on Sunday! <BR> <BR> <BR>Did I miss anyone? Who’s not here yet? <BR> <BR> <BR>Go Dogs. Go! <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
