<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10158"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Witchking<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Witchking<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 10:12 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Taking a look at the May 5th &#39;puzzler&#39; BTK sent I think I found something, maybe Wichita PD might want to know what I saw, what do you all think? <BR> <BR>QWCVF--23--MY NAME IS DENNIS RADER, I LIVE AT 6220 INDEPENDENCE PARK CITY KANSAS I KILLED DELORES DAVIS AND MARINE HEDGE. I HAVE QUITE AN EXTENSIVE LIST OF TROPHIES IN MY SHED AND BURIED IN MY YARD I AM THE  <BR>COMPLIANCE OFFICER AND DOG CATCHER--ZXPOFRT <BR>WOTIYUEM--TYRHSNEUEROTIINVG--WIWCVGTG55;PRIE <BR> <BR> <BR>THERE HAVE GOT TO BE SOME CLUES IN THERE SOMEWHERE. <BR> <BR>I wasn&#39;t going to come back really for any reason but there is ONE question, ONE question I would LOVE LOVE LOVE to know the answer to and I fear we&#39;ll never know it. Nancy Fox said something to Dennis the Menace that cut him to his core, she said something he so did not dig hearing my guess is it haunts him to this day. If I were trying to break him down I&#39;d sit a picture of Nancy Fox in front of him all day and make sure an illuminated picture of her is right outside his cell. She said, or DID SOMETHING to merit a both a phone call and a poem. He was so hurt or mad he stopped on his way home to actually call police KNOWING his voice would be recorded. He had to let someone know Nancy Fox was dead, RIGHT NOW. Most everything else will come out, like the fact he used a tape recorder to live out the memories again and again &#40;black doctors bag, or kit, remember&#41;, like the fact he used a searing hot knife to burn Mrs. Otero &#40;I&#39;m not gonna get all ghoulish--not my reason for stopping by&#41; and other horrid things that took place, some things that are already getting out &#40;broken fingers&#41;. I also believe in one of the Park City murders HE GOT A RIDE, no serial killer as meticulous &#40;as Dennis the Menace THOUGHT he was anyway&#41; would leave himself a 2 mile walk back to town or a safe area.... <BR> <BR>Peace<!--/Text--></td></tr>
