<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10164"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Witchking<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Witchking<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 11:25 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I also am of the opinion HE DID NOT post to any boards anywhere. Turd Brain decided to involve himself in the computer age and got burned. Even his pastor said Dennis the Menace didn&#39;t know how to &#39;fire up&#39; the church computer without help. Sounds to me like he was computer illiterate &#40;I mean MOST people who use computers know meta data or ghosting occurs on burned CD&#39;s and disks---many cannot explain it but they KNOW it happens&#41;.  <BR> <BR>Turn Brain should have paid more attention to all his true crime drama books and mags and videos, surely somewhere in there he read about SOMEONE getting busted by a computer snafu. <BR> <BR>Nancy Fox is in this guys head, I KNOW it, everything points to it, I just wnna know WHAT she said that night....Maybe if he took the tape recorder with him we&#39;ll know one day <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
