<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10173"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Iceteajan<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Iceteajan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 12:06 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Witchking, <BR> <BR>I&#39;d like to know &#40;from the victim&#39;s families&#41; if their loved one had the personality type to STAND UP to Dennis in any way. <BR> <BR>Some people can easily walk away from an argument or a bully ... others simply won&#39;t stand for it. <BR> <BR>A little-known fact in the Sharon Tate murder is that she had Charles Manson thrown off her property a few days earlier.  Manson was looking for the Beach Boys -- they moved out deliberately without telling Manson.   <BR> <BR>So Manson came face-to-face with Sharon.  She was not impressed with Charlie and his friends and had him ejected from the property. <BR> <BR>She wasn&#39;t very cordial -- I think Charlie was highly insulted.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
