<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10304"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Fsu44<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Fsu44<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 1:52 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I am here.... but I was thinking Richerich was our man for awhile; Richerich was the only person who had Park City and Seneca St. in one of his postings. Thursday Jan. 27,. BTK owns property in both location.    <BR> <BR>Richerich is to smart to be a dog-cather!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
