</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ed_neil<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 04, 2005 - 10:37 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hey, I&#39;m here!!!  And, Rader may have posted here too under <a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/264/129.html?1109996812#POST1633" target="_blank">Messages From BTK</a> as &#34;-&#34; &#40;dash&#41;, on December 7th and again on the 16th.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
