<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10742"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bluepup<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bluepup<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, March 06, 2005 - 9:49 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->weird, huh?  same last name and was posted here before Dennis Rader was a suspect. &#34;To BTK&#34; page 2 <BR> <BR> <BR>Ruth Rader <BR> Posted on Saturday, December 18, 2004 - 3:00 am:      <BR> <BR>-------------------------------------------------- ------------------------------ <BR>Are you going to contact &#34;America&#39;s Most Wanted&#34; or John Walsh tonight,BTK?  <BR> <BR>He&#39;s hunting you,BTK. And you know it.  <BR> <!--/Text--></td></tr>
