<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10865"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Raedelina<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Raedelina<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 07, 2005 - 10:16 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Here is something that has bothered me for a long time -- from a one-time poster named &#34;Lawrence Bittaker&#34;: <BR> <BR> <BR>Posted on Friday, December 03, 2004 - 7:57 am:      <BR>BTK: I had the Gender Genie analyze the following poem of yours, and it determined it was written by a WOMAN - which suggests you have a female partner acting with you, at least in regard to the poems. Serial killers who have knowledgeable/participatory female partners is not unknown, as you should know, Gerald and Charlene Gallegos and the Lonely Hearts Killers being just two examples.  <BR> <BR>Oh, Anna Why Didn&#39;t You Appear  <BR>T&#39; was perfect plan of deviant pleasure so bold on that Spring niteMy inner felling hot with propension of the new awakening season  <BR>Warn, wet with inner fear and rapture, my pleasure of entanglement,like new vines at night  <BR>Oh, Anna, Why Didn&#39;t You AppearDrop of fear fresh Spring rain would roll down from your nakednessto scent to lofty fever that burns within,  <BR>In that small world of longing, fear, rapture, and desparation,the game we play, fall on devil earsFantasy spring forth, mounts, to storm fury, then winter clam atthe end.  <BR>Oh, Anna Why Didn&#39;t You AppearAlone, now in another time span I lay with sweet enrapture garmentsacross most private thought  <BR>Bed of Spring moist grass, clean before the sun, enslaved withcontrol, warm wind scenting the air, sun light sparkle tearsin eyes so deep and clear.  <BR>Alone again I trod in pass memory of mirrors, and ponder why fornumber eight was not.  <BR>Oh, Anna Why Didn&#39;t You Appear  <BR> <BR>What bothers me also perplexes me here.  If I follow a certain line of reasoning, the forgone conclusion is &#40;to me&#41; either unbelievably fantastic or fantastically unbelievable... <BR> <BR>Lawrence Bittaker is a real person.  He happens to be a sociopath rapist-torturer-murderer who participated in tag-team style evil with a male cohort.  I am not too familiar with Tom&#39;s policies regarding cut-and-paste, so please refer to the Crime Library&#39;s info on L.B.  He is disgustingly cocky and still signs his prison fam mail as &#34;Pliers&#34;, in lovingly sadistic tribute to his active trolling days.  <BR> <BR>So we know he can&#39;t be the real poster as he is most definitely incarcerated.  Why would any other poster choose such an unsavory name?  Most of us care about justice and closure and we are not here to sunbliminally taunt anyone, let alone any kind of victims of violence of any kind.  None of &#34;us&#34; would care to associate ourselves with an abuser, NO DOUBT !!!  <BR> <BR>So, then, who is this one-hit-wonder who has offered such deep insight?  BiTtaKer.  I cannot discount this as a possible BTK communication.  And if so, a very telling one.  It suggests a woman poetry accomplice.  NOT a murder accomplice of any kind.  <BR> <BR>WHY post under the name of Lawrence Bittaker?  He sucked as a human being and evokes NOTHING that this online community stands for, being that he was a sexual sadist and a murderer, not unlike Dennis Rader. <BR> <BR>WHY, then, suggest an accomplice, let alone a completely statistically and evidentiary unbelievable one??? <BR> <BR>I could go on, but I would love some feedback first.  <BR> <BR>Oh, yeah, P.S.  Bittaker = BeeTeeKay-er <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
