<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11010"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 08, 2005 - 9:38 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Bluepete: Thanks for the vote of confidence. I could not have left all that semen at the crime scenes, at least not on an ordinary day. I would really have to be empowered to pull that one &#39;off&#39;. <BR> <BR>No web site as of yet. I am not that computer savvy, so I would have to do some serious study. I do plan to give it some attention, just to broaden my horizons in another direction. At this point in time, I am trying to deal with my 14 baby bunnies on the run. Easter bunnies, anyone? <BR> <BR>On subject: Bittaker made tapes of his victims screams during torture. Maybe BTK did as well. It will take months before they can thoroughly debrief him. If it took 25 years to release the Anna poem, who knows how long it will be before all the facts are given to the public.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
