<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11110"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:rwmm@swbell.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Lilymarie<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lilymarie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 09, 2005 - 9:44 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Zooooooom.....the sound 1/2 of LDawg&#39;s post going right over my head. Chiquitah - LOL- I&#39;m not kidding.  <BR> <BR>Dawg - I was with you - until the drugs wore off and there was nothin&#39; left but the sound of my inner voice saying - &#34;Lily, give up&#34;.  <BR> <BR>But I&#39;m not a quitter...and you know that in a secret perverted way am attracted to you...so could you break it down a bit?  <BR> <BR>Still one of your biggest fans - Lily<!--/Text--></td></tr>
