<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11279"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Hmmm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Hmmm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 11, 2005 - 6:44 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Scroll down on this link <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/59/215.html?1103591007" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/59/215.htm l?1103591007</a> <BR> <BR>Those hmmm&#39;s are not me<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11279-->
<!--Post: 11280--><!--Time: 1110552941-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11280"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Hmmm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Hmmm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 11, 2005 - 6:55 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Just talked with my husband, and he&#39;s never posted here...much less posted as me.  I noticed the hmmm posts don&#39;t have the &#34;Registered: 7-2004&#34; on them.  Is there a reason for that?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
