<!--Post: 11285--><!--Time: 1110556596-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11285"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lostdog<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lostdog<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 11, 2005 - 7:56 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hmmm, <BR> <BR>Tom did not require registration to post in the “BTK message” threads. <BR> <BR>I posted there &#40;in messages to BTK&#41; as pleasedeleteme and Who’sYourFloydW?&#42; before I registered. <BR> <BR>The posts from hmmm &#40;not Hmmm&#41; seem to be an innocent coincidence – though the spelling, punctuation and grammar are a tad Raderesque. <BR> <BR>Those open threads are a good place to look for surreptitious postings from the DCK… if you have the patience. <BR> <BR>lddd <BR>  <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11285-->
<!--Post: 11298--><!--Time: 1110561725-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11298"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lizzie<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lizzie<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 11, 2005 - 9:22 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Has anyone else looked at the posts of gramsleuth? <BR>I found it interesting what gramsleuth posted about BTK&#39;s location when analyzer mapped marine hedge and the other close murders, gramsleuth posted: <BR> <BR>Gramsleuth <BR>Username: Gramsleuth <BR> <BR>Registered: 12-2004 <BR> Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 7:30 pm:      <BR> <BR>-------------------------------------------------- ------------------------------ <BR>ANALYZER, THANKS FOR THE MAPS. They make everything so much clearer.  <BR> <BR>WPD has a big problem. The map practically screams out where the BTK lives. And yet the police can&#39;t find him. They are incompetent.  <BR> <BR>That map did in fact pretty much show where he lived... <BR> <BR>gramsleuth, how did you know?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11298-->
<!--Post: 11679--><!--Time: 1111021963-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11679"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tac<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tac<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 16, 2005 - 5:12 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dear Teardrop, <BR> <BR>What inspired the name teardrop ? I was thinking it was related to &#34;teardrop&#34; tattos that are symbolic prison markings for murder or time served. <BR> <BR>One of the reasons I chose the name &#34;tac&#34; is because it is prison slang for tattoo. You never seemed interested in this connection why ? <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11679-->
<!--Post: 11771--><!--Time: 1111151923-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11771"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 18, 2005 - 5:18 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Wasn&#39;t aware of it, I guess. I write poetry, usually dark and heartbroken, so I guess that is why I used Teardrop. The last line from one called Love&#39;s Golgotha: With the cross of your memory on my back, I walk day and endless night to the Place of the Skull. I can come up with an occassional optimistic one, though, but not very often. And, I have yet another 3 new baby bunnies! I am in shock. I cannot imagine how this could have happened. Later...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11771-->
<!--Post: 12118--><!--Time: 1111606435-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12118"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 23, 2005 - 11:33 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hey - where the heck is everybody today?  Am I the only one here? <BR>Teardrop...haven&#39;t seen any posts from you for a couple of days.... <BR>Maybe everyone is just burnt out on DTDC???? <BR>But I miss everybody&#39;s posts...even when they are bizarre and off topic<IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/sad.gif" ALT=":-&#40;" BORDER=0> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12118-->
<!--Post: 12167--><!--Time: 1111684045-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12167"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Chiquitah<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Chiquitah<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 24, 2005 - 9:07 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Haven&#39;t heard anything new on him. Wonder if he finds it hard to handle that he isn&#39;t the #1 topic in the news lately.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12167-->
<!--Post: 12191--><!--Time: 1111729028-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12191"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 24, 2005 - 9:37 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Still here.  Things are slow since DR has been apprehended, and I guess that it will be until the trial nears, or something breaks open, like family background. I have been trying to email the Eagle my questions to be answered. The spam stopper won&#39;t allow the word &#39;sex&#39; to be in the email, so my postmaster is supposed to be working on that. <BR> <BR>Yes, BTK hardly gets any coverage now. His ratings have really slipped.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12191-->
<!--Post: 12611--><!--Time: 1112561545-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12611"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Flytodeb<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Flytodeb<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, April 03, 2005 - 1:52 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->While we are waiting for news on the BTK suspect, here is an article about Wichita. It is not as boring as everyone seems to think. <BR>-Deb <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.kansas.com/mld/kansas/entertainment/11296765.htm" target=_top>http://www.kansas.com/mld/kansas/entertainment/112 96765.htm</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12611-->
<!--Post: 12614--><!--Time: 1112574043-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12614"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lostdog<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lostdog<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, April 03, 2005 - 5:20 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Deb, <BR> <BR>Enjoyed your link on Wichita history and lore. <BR> <BR>So, it turns out that Dennis the Menace of Sunday comic and sitcom fame is a Wichitan... <BR> <BR>And all this time I thought Mr. Wilson was the sociopath! <BR> <BR>RuffDog<!--/Text--></td></tr>
